My recommendation for your interview preparation

Since you're preparing for Java + Spring Boot interviews, master these topics in this order:

Classes & Objects
Constructors
this and super
Inheritance
Polymorphism (Overloading & Overriding)
final, static, abstract
Abstract Classes
Interfaces
Association, Aggregation, Composition
Inner Classes
Object class (equals(), hashCode(), toString(), clone())
Collections Framework
Exception Handling
Multithreading
Java 8 features (Lambda, Functional Interfaces, Streams, Optional)
JVM Memory (Heap, Stack, String Pool, Garbage Collection)

These topics cover the vast majority of Java interview questions asked in startup, product-based, and enterprise Java backend interviews.
